<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Owens-Illinois raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Owens-Illinois raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it raised its rating on Owens-Illinois Inc to trading buy from moderate outperform.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 3/8 at 15-7/8.</p>
</text>
